  "descriptionModule": {
   "briefSummary": "This study compares the effect of two medicines on COPD (Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease). This study will last up to 18 weeks, and subjects will visit the clinic 5 times. Subjects will be given breathing tests, and will record their breathing symptoms daily on diary cards.",
   "detailedDescription": "Clinical Evaluation of GW815SF for Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (Chronic Bronchitis, Emphysema) \"Assessment of the Effect of Addition of Fluticasone Dipropionate to Salmeterol Xinafoate 50µg after Switching under Double-blinded conditions to GW815SF 50/250µg in Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease"
  },
